    "The same unchanged Unity snapshot completes the explicit normal WinFail\u2192remaining-moves\u2192result\u2192Continue/context-exit regression, including a real entry debit and one persisted life refund, level2/star1, full25-move conversion and native coin accounting. This verifier still opens RecoveryPreview and supplies feature/Home/King/etc boundaries; it is not production GameScene composition or physical play proof."
